{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营","docCount":3,"url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"retention-lifecycle","title":"留存与生命周期管理","url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/retention-lifecycle","wordCount":1120,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"compliance-audit-trail","title":"合规与审计追踪","url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/compliance-audit-trail","wordCount":1417,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-optimization-sampling","title":"成本优化与采样策略","url":"/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/cost-optimization-sampling","wordCount":1349,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 运营\n\n日志系统投产后面临三重持续挑战：数据量按天增长带来的存储成本压力、法规合规要求的审计留痕义务、以及在不牺牲排障能力前提下的采样与降本策略。本章提供生产环境日志系统运营的工程方法——不是一次性的架构设计，而是持续运转的生命周期管理。\n"}